            <span id="alg3.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Benign Eavesdropper</span><span id="alg3.l10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (for training purpose only):
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
              
